sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch12-14> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-14--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-14--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch12-14: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.53" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.525"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.6"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The empirical content is that shell similarity is an unsafe guide to consanguinity wherever form is physically determined. Public sequences and image sets can measure that discordance for planktonic foraminifera and, more thinly, for other groups. The further demand to revise classification is a methodological conclusion that the same discordance does not uniquely dictate. The test is therefore informative about convergence and incomplete as a verdict on taxonomic practice." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Predict genetic or stratigraphic relatedness from shell-shape similarity and compare that prediction with one based on molecular characters. The empirical core is supported if shape neighbors are often distant on sequence trees; it is weakened if shape distance remains a reliable predictor of relatedness after the physically forced characters are removed." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "How much discordance is enough to 'revise the canons' of classification is a judgment, not a threshold in the claim.", "Shape-based names enter both the morphological distances and the labels on many sequences." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-14--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-14--grok--dataset-2>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-14--grok--dataset-3> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-14--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch12-14 by Grok 4.7: 0.46" ;
